  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impacting Legislative Delivery, Governance and Electoral Reforms</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project seeks to strengthen the legislature and key accountable institutions particularly the National assembly to develop strategic legislative agenda; promote the passage of critical constitutional and electoral reforms through working with relevant committees within the NASS. The project would be supporting increased citizens engagement on democratic and electoral issues through working with the Nigeria Civil Society Situation Room and other stakeholder groups.</narrative>
  </description>
